category: Audio
build-depends: cygport check gettext-devel libiconv-devel libshout-devel libtag_c-devel libxml2-devel
sdesc: "Command line source client for Icecast media streaming servers"
ldesc: "Ezstream is a command line source client for Icecast media streaming servers.
It began as the successor of the old shout utility, and has since gained a
lot of useful features."
